# Controls what `gcloud run deploy --source=.` uploads to Cloud Build.
#
# IMPORTANT: presence of this file makes gcloud ignore .gitignore entirely for the source
# upload - without it, gcloud falls back to .gitignore, which excludes config/site.yaml and
# context/* (real deployment content, gitignored on purpose so it never gets committed) and
# they silently never reach the image, even though `docker build` locally works fine.
# config/site.yaml and context/ are deliberately NOT excluded here - they need to be baked
# into the image (see Dockerfile / README "Deploying to Cloud Run").

.git/
.gitignore
.gcloudignore

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
tests/

.env
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
